@baseUrl = https://localhost:7216
# Isi token hanya secara lokal; jangan commit token atau password asli.
@accessToken =

### Tanpa token: harus 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### JWT Admin/Reader: 200 setelah token diisi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### CORS development: 204 dengan header origin
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: authorization,content-type

### Swagger runtime (Development)
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

###
